    <a href="https://www.six-group.com/de/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/etfs-etps-and-funds.html"><div class="img">
      <img alt="ETFs, ETPs und Fonds" data-six-img='{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/the-swiss-stock-exchange/Header/etp-etf-fund.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].png","standard":[80,160,240,510,720,1020,1250,1920]}'></div>
<div class="cell">
    
    <h3 class="teaser-title">ETFs, ETPs und Fonds</h3>

<p>Sichern Sie sich den Zugang zu einer kapitalkräftigen globalen Investorenbasis.</p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Mehr erfahren</span>
    </div></a></li>
